VALUES (22561, 'tt0074121', NULL, 'Allegro non troppo', 'Allegro non troppo', 'movie', 1976, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xRAnD7yd6Qx8NYXfoW5GN6K5jiC.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v7AeBq31MyRS9S8ixZ9kkpt9k78.jpg', 'An enterprising producer believes he has hit upon a winning concept: a program of original animated shorts set to classical music. Undeterred by warnings that this has already been done by an American named ''Prisney,'' he rallies an orchestra of geriatric women, a bullish conductor, and an animator that he keeps locked in the dungeon. What could go wrong?', NULL, NULL, 2.4204, 7.1, 0, 10.52, '2026-10-17 15:53:06', '2026-10-17 15:53:06')
