VALUES (89237, 'tt2139843', NULL, 'Electrick Children', 'Electrick Children', 'movie', 2012, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lWszypKqAt91GFtRP2HyUP6UdOq.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cMNQMG3lqBIgbGgEgolm2jc1djB.jpg', 'Rachel is a rambunctious girl from a polygamist colony in southern Utah. On Rachel’s 15th birthday, she finds a forbidden cassette tape. Having never seen anything like it before, Rachel plays the cassette tape, and finds glorious rock & roll thereupon. Weeks later, Rachel realizes a miracle has occurred - and the cassette tape must have something to do with it. She leaves her family and runs away to the closest city: Las Vegas. There she searches for the singer of the band on the cassette tape.', NULL, NULL, 1.5082, 6.4, 0, 8.012, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-10-17 15:53:06')
