VALUES (4523, 'tt0461770', NULL, 'Enchanted', 'Enchanted', 'movie', 2007, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8KCNzCArLlvLdQoHx6npua2VSVc.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u4UpRDi0w84aNrigr9p049rMHiy.jpg', 'The beautiful princess Giselle is banished by an evil queen from her magical, musical animated land and finds herself in the gritty reality of the streets of modern-day Manhattan. Shocked by this strange new environment that doesn''t operate on a "happily ever after" basis, Giselle is now adrift in a chaotic world badly in need of enchantment. But when Giselle begins to fall in love with a charmingly flawed divorce lawyer who has come to her aid - even though she is already promised to a perfect fairy tale prince back home - she has to wonder: Can a storybook view of romance survive in the real world?', NULL, NULL, 11.3809, 6.847, 0, 6.043333333333333e+00, '2026-08-09 02:29:31', '2026-10-17 15:53:06')
